# Konfirmasi & info error mobile: pakai bottom sheet

Semua **konfirmasi** (hapus, kirim, logout, dsb.) dan **info error** di mobile
harus lewat **bottom sheet** (`showModalBottomSheet` / `showAppErrorSheet`),
**bukan** `showDialog` + `AlertDialog`.

## Sudut rounded (jangan diubah)

Radius sheet (10px, `RoundedSuperellipseBorder`) sudah diset tema Forui lewat
`_materialTheme()` di `mobile/lib/app.dart` + `clipBehavior: Clip.antiAlias`.
Tanpa clip, Material anak full-bleed menutup sudut = kotak. **Jangan** set
`shape:`/`clipBehavior:` per-call - biarkan ambil dari tema supaya seragam.

## Kenapa

- `AlertDialog` butuh ancestor `Material`; di pohon Forui (`FScaffold`,
  `FTileGroup`) sering crash `No Material widget found`.
- Bottom sheet aman di Forui, konsisten UX, tidak menggeser layout.
- `showAppErrorSheet` sudah handle error code `RATE_LIMITED` → toast,
  lain → sheet penuh, lalu `clearError` otomatis.

## Pola wajib

### 1. Konfirmasi aksi destruktif / penting

```dart
// ❌ BAD - AlertDialog
final ok = await showDialog<bool>(
  context: context,
  builder: (_) => AlertDialog(
    title: Text('Hapus akun?'),
    actions: [
      TextButton(onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(context, false), child: Text('Batal')),
      TextButton(onPressed: () => Navigator.pop(context, true), child: Text('Hapus')),
    ],
  ),
);

// ✅ GOOD - Bottom sheet pakai FTile/FTileGroup (Forui-native)
final ok = await showModalBottomSheet<bool>(
  context: context,
  useRootNavigator: true,
  isScrollControlled: true,
  builder: (_) => Padding(
    padding: MediaQuery.of(context).viewInsets,
    child: Column(
      mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
      children: [
        FTileGroup(
          children: [
            FTile(title: Text('Hapus akun?'), subtitle: Text('Tindakan ini permanen.')),
            FTile(
              suffix: FButton(
                style: FButtonStyle.destructive,
                onPress: () => Navigator.pop(context, true),
                child: Text('Hapus'),
              ),
            ),
            FTile(
              suffix: FButton(
                onPress: () => Navigator.pop(context, false),
                child: Text('Batal'),
              ),
            ),
          ],
        ),
      ],
    ),
  ),
);
```

### 2. Error setelah submit form

```dart
// ❌ BAD - FAlert sticky di body
if (state.errorMessage != null)
  FAlert(variant: FAlertVariant.destructive, title: Text(state.errorMessage!)),

// ✅ GOOD - showAppErrorSheet (sudah handle rate-limit & clearError)
ref.listen(provider.select((s) => s.errorMessage), (_, msg) {
  if (msg == null || !context.mounted) return;
  showAppErrorSheet(context, message: msg).whenComplete(() {
    if (context.mounted) ref.read(provider.notifier).clearError();
  });
});
```

### 3. Info singkat / non-blocking (sukses, rate-limit)

Pakai `showFToast` (bukan sheet, bukan dialog).

## Cek cepat sebelum commit

```bash
# Harus kosong di mobile/lib (kecuali test / dev tool)
grep -rn "showDialog\|AlertDialog" mobile/lib --include="*.dart" | grep -v test | grep -v dev_tool
```

Hasil harus **kosong**. Kalau ada, ganti ke bottom sheet / toast.

## File utilitas siap pakai

- `mobile/lib/shared/utils/error_bottom_sheet.dart` → `showAppErrorSheet`
- `mobile/lib/shared/utils/toast.dart` → `showFToast`